#: ipaserver/plugins/passwd.py:40
msgid ""
"\n"
"Set a user's password\n"
"\n"
"If someone other than a user changes that user's password (e.g., Helpdesk\n"
"resets it) then the password will need to be changed the first time it\n"
"is used. This is so the end-user is the only one who knows the password.\n"
"\n"
"The IPA password policy controls how often a password may be changed,\n"
"what strength requirements exist, and the length of the password history.\n"
"\n"
"If the user authentication method is set to password+OTP, the user should\n"
"pass the --otp option when resetting the password.\n"
"\n"
"EXAMPLES:\n"
"\n"
" To reset your own password:\n"
"   ipa passwd\n"
"\n"
" To reset your own password when password+OTP is set as authentication "
"method:\n"
"   ipa passwd --otp\n"
"\n"
" To change another user's password:\n"
"   ipa passwd tuser1\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Iestatīt lietotāja paroli\n"
"\n"
"Ja lietotāja paroli maina kāds cits, nevis pats lietotājs (piem., palīdzības "
"dienests\n"
"to atiestata), parole būs jāmaina pirmajā\n"
"lietošanas reizē. Tas tiek darīts, lai paroli zinātu tikai galalietotājs.\n"
"\n"
"Ja lietotāja autentifikācijas metode ir iestatīta uz parole+OTP, atiestatot "
"paroli,\n"
"lietotājam jānorāda opcija --otp.\n"
"\n"
"IPA paroļu politika nosaka, cik bieži paroli var mainīt,\n"
"kādas ir stipruma prasības un paroļu vēstures garumu.\n"
"\n"
"PIEMĒRI:\n"
"\n"
" Lai atiestatītu savu paroli:\n"
"   ipa passwd\n"
"\n"
" Lai atiestatītu savu paroli, ja autentifikācijas metode ir parole+OTP:\n"
"   ipa passwd --otp\n"
"\n"
" Lai mainītu cita lietotāja paroli:\n"
"   ipa passwd tuser1\n"

